{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/4867fd7c3eeef04fb2775fb46a594569.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1232 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forty years old, no savings, no plan, and a mom who waits for rent every single week. Welcome to Mervin\u2019s world \u2013 the adulthood simulator where every task spirals out of control faster than you can blink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple. Earn enough money to finally move out of your mom\u2019s house. How you do it? That\u2019s up to you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/f47a2e71819f80ccd714987fb6668679.poster.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1170 height=950 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/f47a2e71819f80ccd714987fb6668679.webm?t=1773311800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck at the casino, go all in on crypto, or befriend some shady characters! Just remember\u2014you can lose everything just as fast, and when that happens\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/240afbdc3b40a3880e5b51d68191cced.poster.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/240afbdc3b40a3880e5b51d68191cced.webm?t=1773311800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honest work? A nightmare. But sometimes it\u2019s the only option. Mow lawns, scrub toilets, or work at the garbage sorting facility\u2014earn slowly, but honestly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/cf55f1f86123ae9d3d15fa4f72199267.poster.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/cf55f1f86123ae9d3d15fa4f72199267.webm?t=1773311800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short on cash for rent? Pick up a side gig dancing at a strip club. Completely broke? Challenge your mom to a fistfight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/36e333dcfaa073f7bbe1c604ecf9c8a7.poster.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/36e333dcfaa073f7bbe1c604ecf9c8a7.webm?t=1773311800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life isn\u2019t just about work. Hit the gym, paint some pictures, or befriend a goldfish so you don\u2019t lose your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/b7c775fc0d77332d4f5a91ad070867a0.poster.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/b7c775fc0d77332d4f5a91ad070867a0.webm?t=1773311800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, nothing is normal. Dialogues drip with dark humor, characters balance on the edge of absurdity, and at every step you\u2019ll be asking yourself: \u201cWTF?!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">What\u2019s Inside?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wild storyline packed with absurd choices and unpredictable consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of 2D and 3D tasks, a fully interactive room, and Mervin\u2019s command center \u2013 his Doors XD computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of absurd mini-games inspired by Mervin\u2019s most ridiculous jobs and side hustles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing Mervin\u2019s needs such as sleep, hunger, and bladder (beware, he can be moody!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room customization and a progression system shaping your chaotic lifestyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black humor dialogues and a cast of bizarre, over-the-top characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday activities to (barely) keep Mervin sane: gym, painting, weird hobbies, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crazy blend of simulation, comedy, and the painful struggle of adult life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add <i>Nerd Simulator</i> to your wishlist and get ready for the weirdest adulthood simulation ever\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Golden Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/f6f96801f349c109a9c5483928eb5e768f317222.jpg"},{"name":"IT-Jesus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/08eec47b9c9bcd973eb6f55055ad91dad44b23a0.jpg"},{"name":"Disabled and Happy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/d71328af705793b3fbd216d521e7c11656dddeda.jpg"},{"name":"Money Up in Smoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/04485ebd1cb4c088322e95cfc038dd88b4126609.jpg"},{"name":"CornHub Gourmet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/a3f32c0e3c802575a43b80278c75ff5cbcf7132a.jpg"},{"name":"Friendo-Eater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/79a8cb015f363c1d7330bbba41071f861c5419db.jpg"},{"name":"Pizza Hurt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/a44c4642c4e3b43d60c415e075da10006f7f3e2e.jpg"},{"name":"Habibi Kebs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/9742099af9aba179af119703e325bd03ebe34eac.jpg"},{"name":"Mom vs Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/5231e46a6a1bc539d95ce3e73d0ac26314786906.jpg"},{"name":"Maybe We Can Talk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3128220/d6c0abade5fcdeb67a3071335b7c988ee11619e9.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3128220?t=1773311800","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773311800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/0c185ffc4b0bb57e32645068b46fdb7e60a1ad2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773311800","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/0c185ffc4b0bb57e32645068b46fdb7e60a1ad2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773311800","categories":[{"description