/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/240afbdc3b40a3880e5b51d68191cced.poster.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/240afbdc3b40a3880e5b51d68191cced.webm?t=1773311800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honest work? A nightmare. But sometimes it\u2019s the only option. Mow lawns, scrub toilets, or work at the garbage sorting facility\u2014earn slowly, but honestly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/cf55f1f86123ae9d3d15fa4f72199267.poster.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/cf55f1f86123ae9d3d15fa4f72199267.webm?t=1773311800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short on cash for rent? Pick up a side gig dancing at a strip club. Completely broke? Challenge your mom to a fistfight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/36e333dcfaa073f7bbe1c604ecf9c8a7.poster.avif?t=1773311800\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/36e333dcfaa073f7bbe1c604ecf9c8a7.webm?t=1773311800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L